  "limitations": [
    "25 cases, one display, one machine.",
    "Vision is sampled and varies run to run: three vision-only runs on the four icon cases gave 2, 0 and 3 correct. Every vision-dependent figure carries that variance.",
    "Two unlabelled AXTextField cases remain unreachable by every source; they are not an arbitration problem.",
    "sim-ambiguous remains ambiguity_missed under both rules. The corpus expects 'the save control' to be ambiguous; both rules resolve it.",
    "The frame-identity guard in _fuse is reached only when two candidates carry vision evidence and neither's source set contains the other's, because the source-subset check deduplicates first."
  ]
